{% comment %}
  Sourboo FAQ Section
  "get your FAQs of what you put in ur mouth"
{% endcomment %}

<section class="sb-faq-section" aria-label="Frequently Asked Questions">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px;">
    <h2 class="font-coolvetica text-pink" style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.4rem); margin: 0; line-height: 1;">
      get your <span class="font-rascal" style="color: var(--sb-pickle-green);">FAQs</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="font-schoolbell" style="font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.6rem); margin: 6px 0 0; color: #1D1D1D;">
      of what you put in ur mouth
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sb-faq-list">
    <div class="sb-faq-item open">
      <button type="button" class="sb-faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="true">
        <span>1. what is it made of?</span>
        <span class="sb-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="sb-faq-answer">
        <p>sourboo is made using sliced gherkins, flavoured for that sharp, mouth-watering hit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sb-faq-item">
      <button type="button" class="sb-faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>2. is sourboo vegetarian?</span>
        <span class="sb-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="sb-faq-answer">
        <p>yes!! 100% vegetarian.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sb-faq-item">
      <button type="button" class="sb-faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>3. is this a pickle?</span>
        <span class="sb-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="sb-faq-answer">
        <p>nope not in the traditional sense. it's not meant to sit quietly next to your meal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sb-faq-item">
      <button type="button" class="sb-faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>4. how do i eat it?</span>
        <span class="sb-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="sb-faq-answer">
        <p>straight from the jar. no cooking needed. add it to chaat or snacks if you want but it holds its own.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sb-faq-item">
      <button type="button" class="sb-faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>5. how should i store it?</span>
        <span class="sb-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="sb-faq-answer">
        <p>store in a cool, dry place and once opened, refrigerate and keep the lid closed properly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Accordion",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ Accordion"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
